# M7 flow (D-017, D-047, D-106): game over in Café Zauner -> continue
# restarts Café Zauner (not the run's first stage, Strobl) and the boss.
# Title flow with the run started in Strobl: flow_m6_bad_ischl_to_cafe_zauner's
# 5703 frames (Strobl and Bad Ischl cleared, the Café Zauner intro from
# 5643), 90 more frames of the intro, play from 5793 (play frame = frame
# - 5793). Life 1: cafe_zauner_boss_win_normal's inputs to its frame 1316
# (hit 1 at 7007), then m7_boss_death_reset's (the round-2 volley's first
# bill: a death at 7364). Respawn at the checkpoint (112) through the
# intro, play from 7574. Lives 2 and 3, the same 1011 frames each from
# the respawn: a walk to the step, onto the Tortenvitrine, right until
# the arena locks, back onto the refuge, a step off onto his head in his
# first breather (hits at 8042 and 9053: the boss has 1 hit each time),
# back onto the refuge, then a walk across the floor into him at the
# right wall in his volley (deaths at 8375 and 9386). Game over at 9446
# with the boss on 1 hit; START at 9526 -> the Café Zauner intro, play at
# its start (9676): 3 lives, score 0, 0 Oblaten, Normal, the boss back at
# his spawn with no hits; 30 frames of play.
